on/browser-commander/zipball/v0.16.0","body":"### Minor Changes\n\n- a23c0fa: Add installed-browser profile discovery and privacy-preserving cookie import for Chrome, Edge, Brave, Chromium, and Firefox, including OS credential caching and Playwright/Puppeteer-compatible output."}ℹ️ Found Minor Changes section
